<title>FRANCE: France's Chirac to visit India next year.</title>
<headline>France's Chirac to visit India next year.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>French President Jacques Chirac will pay an official visit to India next year, official sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>French radio quoted Indian Ambassador Ranjit Sethi as saying the visit would take place in January, but the Elysee palace and a diplomat at the Indian embassy declined to confirm a date.</p>
</text>
